WEBVTT

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:32.897
a scoreboard where you map
out your first idea,

00:05:32.897 --> 00:05:39.163
but you constantly adapt it until you have
enough evidence that your business

00:05:39.163 --> 00:05:42.397
model could work. And that's
when you start to scale.

00:05:42.830 --> 00:05:46.163
Let me give you two examples. One
that worked and one that didn't.

00:05:46.930 --> 00:05:52.430
So the first one is a startup called
Better Place. They had an amazing idea.

00:05:52.430 --> 00:05:57.163
They asked, what's the biggest challenge
with electric vehicles? It's a charging.

00:05:57.163 --> 00:05:59.730
It takes time. So what if we built

00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:03.763
a battery swapping infrastructure where
you could drive in with your electric